OL,3,GNEWSAThe skull of a saint that was
OL,4,Adiscovered during renovations
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 25 April 1641, Ambrose Barlow
OL,7,Fcelebrated a secret Easter Sunday mass
OL,8,Fat Morleys Hall near Astley in Greater
OL,9,FManchester.
OL,11,FBut, by the end of the service, the
OL,12,Fbuilding had been surrounded by a
OL,13,F400-strong armed group led by a local
OL,14,Fvicar.
OL,16,F"King Charles I issued a decree stating
OL,17,Fthat all Catholic priests must leave
OL,18,Fwithin a month...and if they didn't,
OL,19,Fthey would face the consequences of
OL,20,Ftreason," said the Right Reverend John
OL,21,FArnold, the Bishop of Salford.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
